! mcp_bootstrap_p318.strap -- MCP printed page 318: the DISK FETCH
! data area (X N FOST .. C DIC EX), the unknown-key exit (C XUK, C XIT,
! C EPGK, C XUKND), the C DSK FL message, C LOC CT and CW RD.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.69, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID SB000307  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 318"; the heading row's
! LOCATION field is 234212, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  45 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it, and a
! "*" follows the LOCATION on lines 9, 22 and 43.  No remark cards, no
! TAIL card.  Contiguous from 234212.40 (line 1) to 234416.00 (line 45,
! CW, a full word; next location 234417.00), then blank paper.
!   lines  1-8   VF / XW data words (printed "+" values).
!   lines  9-12  DRZ: (2) words, 40 (N) = 50 octal words, (50) = 62
!                octal, (2); each next LOCATION confirms the count.
!   line  22     C LR DRZ(BU,64),(11) = 13 octal words.
!   line  43     (IQS*)DD(BU),OPERATOR--REPEATED UKS ON DISK  *  : the
!                "*" is the delimiter; 4 words to 234415.00.  Two blanks
!                before it on the ink; any 25-32 characters fill the same
!                4 words, so the next LOCATION does not fix the count.
! JOIN.  p.313 (b8decks) ends at 234021.40; pp.314-317 have no scratch
! deck, so the back join is NOT established here.  p.319 should open at
! 234417.00 with serial SB000344.  This page DEFINES symbols other
! pages carried as stand-ins (XNFOST, CALPHA, CDELTA, CBUFF, CDICT,
! CNDXAD, CNTBUF, CFOT, CINDEX, CBFMAP, CLR, CLUK, CWRD): every one of
! those stand-in addresses agrees with this page's LOCATION column.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "C CIC EX" (line 12) = CDICEX: line 23 prints "CDICEX+1.09" with
!     a plain D, and 234355.11 = 234354.00 + 1.09.  D with a worn stem.
!   * "B, C MCP" (line 20) = B,DMCP (000040.10; DMCP is 32.0).
!   * "SIC,SCISIC" / "B,SCISP" (lines 35, 36) = SDISIC / SDISP (landed
!     values 217451.40 / 217372.0).  "SIC,CRCBR" (line 30) = CRDBR
!     (234164.00, as b8decks pp.312-313).
!   * ",DLCCS" (27) = DLOCS (3.01); ",PRCSA" (28) = PROSA (1.0, the
!     b8decks pp.312-313 spelling); ",DCCMM" (38) = DCOMM (35.32 =
!     000043.40).  The drum's open O.
!   * CLOCCT (line 44): the third glyph is CLOSED at 900 dpi -> O.
!   * CRD1 (line 31): last glyph has the 1's flag at 900 dpi; D plain.
!   * hex "C0" on B/BE rows 16, 18, 31, 36 = 00; "BC" on line 24 = B0;
!     octal/VF fields with an open round read 0; "VF,C" / "XW,C" /
!     "CW,0,0,C" = 0.
!   * names spaced by the drum (X N FOST, C ALPHA, C NDX AD, CNT BUF,
!     CW DISK, C BF MAP, C DIC EX, C XIT, C LR, CW RD) written closed up.
!     CBFMAP, CFOT are C22-6728 spellings; C22-6728 OCR prints "OW DISK"
!     (CW DISK).
!
! EXTERNALS.  CUKCNT and CRD1 are defined on no landed or staged page:
! their values come only from this page's binary.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  SB000307 .. SB000343, none skipped.  Shared: 13-14
! (319), 15-16 (320), 17-18 (321), 20-21 (323), 30-31 (332), 32-33
! (333), 35-36 (335), 41-42 (340).

DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed (p.105); B lines 20,26,32,37,41 000040.10
DRET    SYN, 33.0                    ! landed (p.105); null op lines 21,33,42 000041.00
DCOMM   SYN, 35.32                   ! landed (p.105); null op line 38 000043.40 (printed "DCCMM")
DLOCS   SYN, 3.01                    ! landed p.104 line 15 "D LOC S"; line 27 000003.01 (printed "DLCCS")
PROSA   SYN, 1.0                     ! not landed; as b8decks p.312/313; line 28 000001.00 (printed "PRCSA")
SEPGK   SYN,(16)0801.0               ! landed p.107 line 35; LVI line 34 004001.35
SDISIC  SYN, (8)217451.40            ! landed p.103; SIC line 35, BIT-EXACT (printed "SCISIC")
SDISP   SYN, (8)217372.0             ! landed; B line 36 217372.10, half word only (printed "SCISP")
ADSKRD  SYN, (8)234210.0             ! not landed; as b8decks p.312/313; CM0000 line 19 234210.00, BIT-EXACT
CUKCNT  SYN, (8)234210.40            ! not landed; M-1 line 24 234210.40, BIT-EXACT (from this page only)
CRDBR   SYN, (8)234164.0             ! not landed; as b8decks p.312/313; SIC line 30 234164.00, BIT-EXACT (printed "CRCBR")
CRD1    SYN, (8)234161.0             ! not landed; B line 31 234161.10, half word only (from this page only)

        SLC, (8)234212.40
XNFOST  VF,0                                                 ! line  1  -STATUS OF INFORMATION AVAILABLE
CALPHA  VF, 0                                                ! line  2  -ALPHA EQUALS BETA PLUS ARC-WORD
CDELTA  VF, 0                                                ! line  3  -DELTA EQUALS NO. OF WDS READ
